# src/core/tooling/lsp_server.cheng
# Cheng LSP Server -- versioned semantic snapshots, not local parsing.
# Implemented semantic queries only emit pinned CompilerFact results.
# Missing projections are unavailable and fail without stale answers.
# JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio.

